Syntax: cast 'boiling blood' <target>

Boiling Blood is a devastating offensive ritual that calls upon the loa to
superheat the blood within a victim's body. The ritual requires deep
concentration and communion with the spirits, channeling their dark power
to cook the target from within.

This attack deals significant internal damage that bypasses most physical
armor. The victim experiences intense agony as their blood approaches the
boiling point, potentially causing lasting harm even if they survive.

The ritual carries considerable risk for the shaman. A failed casting may
cause the dark energies to rebound, inflicting similar torment upon the
caster. Only experienced houngans should attempt this ritual, and even
then with caution.

See Also: SOUL TWIST, LIFE LEECH, DISTORT
